# Annual / myTax — Motor vehicle expenses (learned 2026-08-27)

## UI

**ATO Lodgment → Annual income (myTax N/A)** → ATO entry order → **Motor vehicle expenses**  
Field: `MYTAX_MOTOR_VEHICLE`  
Path: `myTax → Business/sole trader → Expenses → Motor vehicle expenses`

## Product truth (user-confirmed) — airfare ≠ motor

| Category / spend | `MYTAX_MOTOR_VEHICLE`? |
|------------------|------------------------|
| Fuel (`EXPENSE_FUEL_TRAVEL`) | **Yes** |
| Motor / vehicle / parking / toll | **Yes** |
| Business airfare / Travel–Transport (`EXPENSE_TRAVEL_TRANSPORT`, e.g. **$1,516.08**) | **No** → `MYTAX_OTHER_EXPENSES` |
| Travel accommodation | **No** |

## Fix (shipped 2026-08-27)

`isMotorExpenseCategory` in `mytax-field-map.ts` excludes `travel_transport`, travel+transport, airfare/flight/airline. Keeps fuel/motor/vehicle/parking/toll.

| | Amount |
|--|--------|
| **Wrong (old UI)** | Motor ~**$2,371.55** (Fuel + airfare, scaled) |
| **Correct (after fix)** | Motor ≈ **$910.82** (Fuel only scaled); airfare → Other |

P&L category Travel–Transport **$1,516.08** unchanged — only Annual bucket map changed.

**Broader ATO work (user 2026-08-27):** all income + expense lodgment lines → **per-line GST-ex** (no FY `scaleMap`) — `accounting-ato-rounding-gst-ex.mdc`. Motor $ will change again when that ships.

## Do not

- Put airfare back into motor for string convenience  
- Change P&L `EXPENSE_TRAVEL_TRANSPORT` unless user asks  
- Equate CTR total expenses with this motor field
